        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0046">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the separator</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is for an electrochemical cell having a sulfur-based cathode, wherein the one or more coating repels hydrophobic polysulfides and increases the performance and cycle life of the electrochemical cell.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0046">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the hydroponic or hydrophobic coating</span>
