        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0046">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a separator of a specific embodiment</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is coated with polyethylene glycol material (hydrophilic) which repels the hydrophobic poly sulfides and, thus hinders the materials passage and capacity loss.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0046">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">polyethylene glycol material</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">hydrophilic</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0046">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">Use of a coating in embodiments of the invention</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is also useful in protecting a Li anode from moisture, say a by a hydrophobic coating on the separator, for example in a lithium-air and lithium water electrochemical cell.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0046">
