        <span itemprop="definition">further includes the step of charging the electrochemical cell. In an embodiment, the method of this aspect further includes the step of cycling the electrochemical cell through a plurality of charge and discharge cycles.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0064">
      </li>
