        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0089">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the first high mechanical strength layer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">comprises a mesh or a foam.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0090">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the mesh or the foam</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">comprises a metal, Ni, stainless steel, tin, Al, Cu, an alloy, a glass, a polymer, Kapton, PE, PP, PET, PTFE, PVDF, SiO 2 , a ceramic, aluminum oxide, carbon, graphite, nanocarbon or any combination of these.</span>
