      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the first high mechanical strength layer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">comprises Kapton, polyethylene, polypropylene, polyethylene terephthalate, poly(methyl methacrylate), a metal coated with a nonconductive material, an alloy coated with a nonconductive material, a polymer, a glass, an aluminum oxide, a silicon oxide, a titanium oxide and any combination of these.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0092">
