        <span itemprop="definition">may include an Anode (e.g., Li-metal or Zinc or Silicon); Separator (e.g., microporous PE or multilayer) or solid electrolyte (e.g., LISICON); Conductive layer (e.g., Ni mesh or stainless steel mesh, or porous nano gold layer); and Cathode (e.g., air cathode with gas diffusion layer or NMC cathode or optionally for FIGS. 44 and 45 LiCoO 2 ).</span>
