        <span itemprop="definition">comprises an anode, such as lithium; one or more porous layers, such as 80% porous PE; a mechanically, chemically, and/or heat resistant layer that is electronically and ionically conductive, such as a perforated metal; a mechanically, chemically and/or heat resistant layer that is ionically conductive but electronically insulating, such as a perforated Kapton layer; a mechanically, chemically and/or heat resistant layer that is electronically and ionically conductive, such as carbon black; and a cathode, such as LiFePO 4 or LiCoO 2 .</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0231">
      </li>
