        <span itemprop="subject">the conductive material proximate the anode</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">reduces anode loss, such as in silicon, where large deformations upon cycling breaks the electronic contact between anode particles and the current collector and deteriorates the performance of the electrochemical cell.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0232">
